direction: right
title: Virtual Machine vs Container Architecture

VM: Virtual Machines (Hardware Virtualization) {
  style.fill: "#0B132B"
  style.stroke: "#0284C7"
  hw: Physical Hardware
  hyp: Hypervisor (ESXi / KVM)
  vm1: "Guest VM 1 (Full OS 2-10GB + App)"
  vm2: "Guest VM 2 (Full OS 2-10GB + App)"
  hw -> hyp -> vm1
  hyp -> vm2
}

Container: Containers (OS-Level Virtualization) {
  style.fill: "#06201B"
  style.stroke: "#10B981"
  hw: Physical Hardware
  kernel: Shared Linux Host Kernel
  runtime: Container Runtime (containerd)
  c1: "Container 1 (Distroless 140MB)"
  c2: "Container 2 (Distroless 140MB)"
  hw -> kernel -> runtime -> c1
  runtime -> c2
}
